<title>UK: UK Nov non-EU trade deficit 639 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Nov non-EU trade deficit 639 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data-</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in million stg)    NOV	OCT    (PREL OCT)</p>
<p>    Trade balance			 -639     -418    (-424)</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			6,031    6,248   (6,272)</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			6,670    6,666   (6,696)</p>
<p>    Oil exports			    263	276     (276)</p>
<p>    Oil imports			    448	413     (410)</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending	 -1,862	N/A  (-1,764)</p>
<p>NOTE - Consensus forecast 641 million stg deficit.</p>
<p>TRADE VOLUME EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Import volume index (base 1990) 147.1    142.1   (142.1)</p>
<p>    Export volume index (base 1990) 137.4    139.3   (139.4)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   1.5%    2.0%    (2.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (imps)  10.0%    9.5%   (10.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   1.0%    1.0%    (1.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (exps)   8.0%   10.0%   (10.0%)</p>
<p>TRADE VALUE EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Balance (million stg)		-569    -313     (-331)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   0.5%    0.5%    (0.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   1.0%    1.0%    (1.0%)</p>
</text>
